  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 4402.01 “Accountable product/motor fuel” means any product which is subject to the reporting requirement of a state, regardless of its intended use or taxability.\n\nSource. #5808, eff 4-14-94; ss by #7221, INTERIM, eff 4-14-00, EXPIRES: 8-12-00; ss by #7288, eff 5-24-00, EXPIRED: 5-24-08\n\nNew. #9377, eff 1-30-09; ss by #10021, eff 11-9-11; ss by #13038, eff 4-20-20",
